1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:05,640
This child has muscle wasting and mosaic
variegated aneuploidy, a condition in which

2
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,160
cells can carry different numbers of
chromosomes.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:12,360
Our question is whether an existing medicine
could improve muscle function while

4
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,960
preserving the cells needed for growth and
repair.

5
00:00:15,209 --> 00:00:18,000
We propose two medicines for laboratory
testing.

6
00:00:19,752 --> 00:00:23,400
BUB1B makes the checkpoint protein BUBR1.

7
00:00:23,617 --> 00:00:29,400
Our stop-plus-missense pair matches a reported
MVA1 pattern: reduced protein supply.

8
00:00:29,744 --> 00:00:33,160
The missense protein's stability and function
remain unmeasured.

9
00:00:33,355 --> 00:00:35,240
Trans phase needs confirmation.

10
00:00:35,519 --> 00:00:40,040
Confirmed cis retires this pair as the
compound-heterozygous explanation.

11
00:00:41,796 --> 00:00:46,080
Niacin is our lead because it targets the
protein-supply hypothesis.

12
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:49,440
It raised muscle NAD in another myopathy.

13
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:54,880
Separate experiments connect NAD and SIRT2 to
BUBR1 stability.

14
00:00:55,148 --> 00:00:57,600
Niacin has not rescued this genotype.

15
00:00:57,773 --> 00:01:01,280
We test whether it increases usable protein
and useful muscle.

16
00:01:03,033 --> 00:01:05,960
Apitegromab is our muscle-support comparator.

17
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,560
It blocks myostatin activation and improved
motor function in a randomized

18
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,360
spinal-muscular-atrophy trial.

19
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:16,040
It now has an approved use, but no MVA
evidence.

20
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,960
Fractures are a labeled risk.

21
00:01:18,145 --> 00:01:22,160
We test useful muscle output, without claiming
that larger muscles repair the

22
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,320
chromosome defect.

23
00:01:25,078 --> 00:01:28,640
Our cell-selection explorer exposes a
misleading result.

24
00:01:28,770 --> 00:01:33,880
In one simulated scenario, the chromosome-
normal fraction rose sixteen point eight

25
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:38,480
percentage points while total differentiated-
cell time fell eleven percent.

26
00:01:38,789 --> 00:01:42,240
Other teams can inspect this tradeoff across
declared assumptions.

27
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:47,000
Our proposed experiment tracks starting cells,
including those that die or stop

28
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,680
dividing.

29
00:01:49,376 --> 00:01:53,920
We would compare affected and genetically
corrected muscle models, using measured drug

30
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,840
exposures.

31
00:01:55,199 --> 00:02:00,080
A medicine must improve either existing muscle
or new muscle production, preserve the

32
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:03,000
other, and avoid worsening chromosome errors.

33
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:06,200
Independent confirmation must reproduce the
result.

34
00:02:06,474 --> 00:02:10,560
The cancer history also requires checking that
neither medicine helps tumor cells

35
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:13,240
survive or interferes with cancer treatment.

36
00:02:14,995 --> 00:02:20,240
Our public drug census screened over fifteen
thousand clinical and regulatory entries.

37
00:02:20,502 --> 00:02:24,920
It made apitegromab a stronger downstream
candidate than everolimus for muscle

38
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:25,600
function.

39
00:02:25,857 --> 00:02:28,720
Everolimus remains a conditional signaling
probe.

40
00:02:28,995 --> 00:02:33,120
Other same-gene genetic and drug findings have
explicit limitations.

41
00:02:33,312 --> 00:02:36,720
Missing evidence stays unknown rather than
becoming a failed drug.

42
00:02:38,476 --> 00:02:42,920
We also ran the workflow on a public,
synthetic TRIP13 example.

43
00:02:43,185 --> 00:02:48,360
It shows why a BUBR1 restoration hypothesis
cannot simply transfer to another gene.

44
00:02:48,702 --> 00:02:51,800
That demonstrates reuse, not treatment
validation.

45
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:56,880
Next we need a consented muscle model and
laboratory partner to test niacin and

46
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,440
apitegromab separately.
